; PUT "INIT-ALIENS";; CALLED AT THE START OF EVERY; SHEET, THIS WILL SET UP ALL; THE DIFFICULTY AND FREQUENCY; OF ALIENS ETC.;; 'SHEET' HOLDS THE SHEET NO.;; FACTORS AFFECTED :-;; A) FREQUENCY OF BREAK IN PIPE.;; B) SIZE OF HOLE.;;    1) MAX 2 IN EARLY LEVELS;    2) MAX 3 IN LATER LEVELS;; C) FREQUENCY THAT ALIENS;    APPEAR :-;;    1) ARROW;    2) BOUNCER;    3) PLANE;    4) SUICIDE;; D) WILL THE JET'S BOMB CAUSE A;    CRATER OR WILL IT JUST GO FOR;    YOUR HEAD !;; E) AMOUNT BY WHICH OIL PRESSURE;    GOES DOWN WHEN A BREAK IN THE;;; F) OVERALL SPEED OF BASIC LOOP -;    THIS WILL INDIRECTLY SPEED UP;    THE RATE THAT WHICH THE OIL;    PRESSURE CONTINUALLY GOES;    DOWN AND THE SPEED OF THE;    BOUNCER & SUICIDE THING.;;;;---------------------------------;; FUNCTIONS OF VARIABLE 'ALSTAT';; BIT #          ALIEN TYPE; ------------------------------;   0            ARROW;   1            BOUNCING BALL;   2            JET;   3            SUICIDE PLANE;   4            JET BOMB CRATER ?;   5            *******;   6            *******;   7            *******;INITAL;LDA #%00011111;STA ALSTAT;;;;;RTS;;;.END